OL,3,GNEWSACritical incident declared amid
OL,4,A'extreme pressure'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA critical incident has been declared
OL,7,Fby the trust that runs Nottingham's two
OL,8,Fmajor hospitals after A&E departments
OL,9,Fsaw three of their highest attendances
OL,10,Fon record over the past two weeks.
OL,12,FNottingham University Hospitals (NUH)
OL,13,FNHS trust - which runs the Queen's
OL,14,FMedical Centre and Nottingham City
OL,15,FHospital - said patients were "having
OL,16,Funacceptable and lengthy waits on
OL,17,Fcorridors".
OL,19,FAccording to NUH, there were more than
OL,20,Fthan 200 patients in A&E, with more
OL,21,Fthan 100 waiting to be seen.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
