OL,3,GNEWSACritical incident declared amid
OL,4,A'extreme pressure'
OL,5,
OL,6,FChief nurse Tracy Pilcher said: "In the
OL,7,Flast 24 hours staff have been working
OL,8,Fhard to do everything they can to
OL,9,Fmitigate the pressures, focusing on
OL,10,Fgetting patients seen and home."
